  "title": "Flutterwave Powers Travelwings to Redefine International Travel Experiences for Nigerians",
  "summary": "Flutterwave, Africa’s leading payment technology company, has announced today that it will be processing payments for Travelwings Nigeria, an online travel agency operating in over 100 destinations worldwide. With an extensive reach across the world, Travelwings is well positioned to enhance travel experiences for millions of Nigerians traveling for business, education, and pleasure. Travelwings has […]",
